{"id":"personalmente","lemma":"personalmente","pos":"adv","rank":1484,"glosses":["personally"],"ipa":"/peɾˌsonalˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"Yo las conozco personalmente.","en":"I know them personally.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458718","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},null]},{"text":"Deberías ir personalmente.","en":"You should go in person.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/509820","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to go"},null]},{"text":"Personalmente creo que tienes razón.","en":"I personally believe that you're right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538344","words":[null,{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"reason"}]},{"text":"Personalmente creo que estás en lo cierto.","en":"I personally believe that you're right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538345","words":[null,{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"a certain, a specific"}]},{"text":"Sé de ella, pero no la conozco personalmente.","en":"I know of her, but I have never met her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/599299","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"she"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},null]}]}